# Build output: `lib/` is generated by `pnpm build` from `src/`.
# It is intentionally NOT committed. The Host and client halves are both
# derived artifacts, and committing them would mean every source edit has to be
# paired with a rebuild or the repository ships a stale plugin. The DSH install
# instructions therefore start with `pnpm build`.
lib/

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Local scratch
.smoke/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Machine-specific local install notes. This file documents the exact edits to
# this developer's own `~/.dsh` profile, including absolute paths, so it must not
# be published with the plugin.
INSTALL-LOCAL.md